# PROPOSAL — DO NOT APPLY (audit-and-propose exercise; no substrate writes)
#
# Target resource : https://pod.vardeman.me/vault/.well-known/solid  (storage description)
# Predicate       : prof:hasResource
# Problem         : two of the six PROF profile pointers 404:
#                     /vault/meta/profiles/source     -> 404  (sources merged into concepts;
#                                                              concept profile exists at .../concept)
#                     /vault/meta/profiles/procedure  -> 404  (the live profile is .../howto;
#                                                              this is a stale pointer, not a
#                                                              rename artifact, but still broken)
# Live profiles    : page (200, root), concept (200), person (200), working (200), howto (200)
#
# This pairs the seeAlso fix (proposal 01). The audit walker only checked seeAlso, so
# these hasResource breakages were found by a manual sweep of the storage description.
#
# As with proposal 01, the storage description is static (PATCH 405). Real fix is the
# Components.js config edit — proposal 04.

@prefix prof: <http://www.w3.org/ns/dx/prof/> .
@prefix solid: <http://www.w3.org/ns/solid/terms#> .

_:patch a solid:InsertDeletePatch ;
  solid:deletes {
    <../> prof:hasResource <../meta/profiles/source> , <../meta/profiles/procedure> .
  } ;
  solid:inserts {
    # 'source' has no live replacement profile — sources are concepts now, so it is
    # simply removed. 'procedure' is corrected to the actual howto profile token.
    <../> prof:hasResource <../meta/profiles/howto> .
  } .
